('sports bar', '1) There are two bars named Proper 21 in DC. We are at Proper 21K', 'and we hope to see you on game day! Location:Proper 21K2033 K Street NWWashington, DC', 'and we hope to see you on game day! Location:Proper 21K2033 K Street NWWashington', 'Buffalo Bills', 'Home of Washington DC Buffalo Bills Backers (Buffalo Bills fan club)', 'Sponsor the Buffalo Bills huddle their members already use on game day', 'Watch venue for Washington DC Buffalo Bills Backers. Address: 1) There are two bars named Proper 21 in DC. We are at Proper 21K, which is between Foggy Bottom and the Farraguts. 2) For those who visit us less often, we are the club that until very recently had been at the Bullpen, in Navy Yard near Nats Park. That facility is no longer a Bills venue. Direct any questions to one of our two co-presidents, Stacie Hauza or Gregory Wahl.NOTE: NOVA Backers at Jimmy''s in Herndon, Frederick Backers at Anchor Bar, and Charm City Backers at Admiral''s Cup in Balto are also great choices; each has its own Facebook group. We are the DC Backers, and we hope to see you on game day! Location:Proper 21K2033 K Street NWWashington, DC 20006'),
